From e13ab66a1ab5e5ce099d6010170a18c1a1b8a0a6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AgentHQ contributors <agenthq@localhost>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 07:26:03 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: AgentHQ Sources and GitHub-optional setup

- GitHub Source becomes optional: a deployment without it skips the GitHub account, gh shim and credential helper
- New local Sources: inbox (Markdown notes per business), timer (cron schedules and ticket wakes), spool (JSON drop folder for programs)
- A throttling 403 from a model relay counts as a transient error and is retried
